{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25997","headline":"隋帝陵下 · 鲍溶","name":"隋帝陵下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白露沾衣隋主宫，云亭月馆楚淮东。\n盘龙楼舰浮冤水，雕锦帆幢使乱风。\n长夜应怜桀何罪，告成合笑禹无功。\n伤心近似骊山路，陵树无根秋草中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}